00:08:22.180 --> 00:08:28.740
is for firms to take the time to develop a call path.

00:08:28.740 --> 00:08:33.300
So not a script, we're pretty anti-scripts, we'll provide scripts, but the goal is to

00:08:33.300 --> 00:08:34.940
get off the script as soon as possible.

00:08:34.940 --> 00:08:38.740
What we mean by call path is like key points, right?

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:44.260
Of the things that the intake team will hit on if they're on the call with a prospect.

00:08:44.260 --> 00:08:46.340
That way it's consistent every time.

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:52.420
We listen to calls all the time where you'll have a rockstar intake specialist will score

00:08:52.420 --> 00:08:56.620
