00:09:42.980 --> 00:09:48.060
What we find is that if you have a quality control system in place, so what does quality

00:09:48.060 --> 00:09:52.540
control mean is an actual protocol that it's on schedule, that's never missed where we

00:09:52.540 --> 00:09:56.460
listen to calls, score them, provide feedback in real time.

00:09:56.460 --> 00:09:58.900
We're looking at the cases that we didn't sign up,

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:02.240
exactly why we didn't sign them up, right?

00:10:02.240 --> 00:10:04.080
We're looking for these opportunities

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:07.280
and we're finding them within 48 hours, right?

00:10:07.280 --> 00:10:09.280
Versus day 200.

00:10:09.280 --> 00:10:11.800
But your biggest rock stars are going to make mistakes.

00:10:11.800 --> 00:10:13.120
Mistakes are okay.

00:10:13.120 --> 00:10:15.200
Sometimes they may not even realize

00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:17.520
