01:18:25.160 --> 01:18:27.680
it wasn't translating to sign cases.

01:18:27.680 --> 01:18:30.640
And I realized we should probably hold up a mirror

01:18:30.640 --> 01:18:34.720
to ourselves and look at what's happening to those calls,

01:18:34.720 --> 01:18:37.640
to those leads, once they come into the firm.

01:18:37.640 --> 01:18:41.720
