01:19:17.760 --> 01:19:21.340
And it's been truly a journey of just trial and error.

01:19:21.340 --> 01:19:24.480
So that's kind of what led me to launch Legal Intake Pros

01:19:24.480 --> 01:19:26.000
about nine months ago.

01:19:26.000 --> 01:19:27.600
Now I have another question.

01:19:27.600 --> 01:19:28.640
I can't help myself,

01:19:28.640 --> 01:19:32.520
but like one of the problems that I see with intake

01:19:32.520 --> 01:19:36.920
is that sometimes the team doesn't expand.

01:19:36.920 --> 01:19:40.800
So it's like, let me throw more marketing dollars,

01:19:40.800 --> 01:19:43.560
which then increases the call volume,

01:19:43.560 --> 01:19:46.400
but it doesn't translate to more cases

01:19:46.400 --> 01:19:50.320
because now the intake is inundated with calls.

01:19:50.320 --> 01:19:52.560
And I just think even emotionally,

01:19:52.560 --> 01:19:55.120
