01:22:32.460 --> 01:22:34.980
And it's weird because it's not like I offer,

01:22:34.980 --> 01:22:36.300
like people think I'm like an expert.

01:22:36.300 --> 01:22:37.660
I'm like, I'm not an expert.

01:22:37.660 --> 01:22:38.860
Like, they're like, well, will you help me?

01:22:38.860 --> 01:22:40.100
I'm like, you don't want me to help you.

01:22:40.100 --> 01:22:43.900
Like, I know it more in theory than like intuitively

01:22:43.900 --> 01:22:46.260
just from like having a sales background, right?

01:22:46.260 --> 01:22:47.860
Then like in practice, right?

01:22:47.860 --> 01:22:49.420
Which is why it's so neat to have you

01:22:49.420 --> 01:22:52.140
